"roadmap":{"phases":[{"n":1,"title":"AI development on the BuB engine","points":["Everything is developed with AI on the BuB engine, using Claude Code.","We need to understand all the legal requirements of publishing a 100% AI-generated game."],"status":"current","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L15 (points trimmed to what is under way; the business-model points are in the planned economy chapter)"},{"n":2,"title":"Ship design and AI-asset library creation","points":["Ship design, completely AI-generated.","Models stored, artbooks created.","Blender is used to produce the models and animations."],"status":"planned","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L30"},{"n":3,"title":"Transfer to Unreal Engine 5","points":["Complete rework from the AI-BuB engine to Unreal Engine 5"],"status":"planned","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L36"},{"n":4,"title":"The Kickstarter trailer","points":["AI-generated trailer is produced along with AI-generated artwork."],"status":"planned","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L40"},{"n":5,"title":"Kickstarter","points":["First round of public fund raising."],"status":"planned","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L44"},{"n":6,"title":"First hires","points":["The first round of developers and graphic designers who lost their jobs to AI are hired with the Kickstarter money."],"status":"planned","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L48"},{"n":7,"title":"Publishing","points":["A game publisher that allows 100% AI-generated content publishes the game."],"status":"planned","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L52"},{"n":8,"title":"Growth","points":["The revenue is used to hire more people and expand the initiative."],"status":"planned","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L56"}],"risks":[{"text":"Built so far by one founder.","src":"DESIGN.md 6.1 rule 13; the company roadmap's mission line says '3 devs' for the future (Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md)"},{"text":"AI-generated assets may have limited copyright protection; we are checking the law.","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L78 (legal checklist 1)"},{"text":"The licence review is still open: an automated similarity scan of the code against the GPL prototype's source ran on 8 Oct 2026, and the expert review of its matches is in progress.","src":"tracker/epics/EP-021-licence-compliance-audit.md (open); tracker/items/ORI-1200-licence-scanner.md (scan, 2026-10-08); docs/LICENSING.md 'Reference works'; DESIGN.md 6.1 rule 4"},{"text":"The economy and online multiplayer are not built, and how paid ships stay fair in player-versus-player is still being designed.","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L116 (Business model; Pay to win and multiplayer)"},{"text":"Moving to Unreal Engine 5 is a rewrite.","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L38 (Phase 3: complete rework); Strategy questions: The UE5 move is a rewrite"}],"src":{"*":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md","phases":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md (one point that names the founder was left out, rule 11)"}},
"mission":{"text":"The company exists to produce a sci-fi video game titled 'Orion-81' and by doing so provide jobs for software engineers and graphic designers who have lost work because of AI.","src":"Orion-81/orion-81-mission/company-roadmap.md#L7 (Mission)"},
